      "wording_status": "faithful paraphrase",
      "attribution": "Fan Chen, Sinho Chewi, Jianfeng Lu, Matthew S. Zhang; canonical affine prerequisite."
    },
    "statement": "The actual pushforward of the normalized Lebesgue Gibbs tilt under x->p+s*x is the normalized Lebesgue tilt with inverse-affine potential x->F(s^-1*(x-p)). The nonzero actual Lebesgue Jacobian cancels between partition and set numerator. This canonical identity alone makes no probability assertion.",
